Checkout page pe customer ek coupon code likhta hai.
 Business ke rules: SAVE10 pe 10% off. FIRST20 pe 20% off, par zyada se zyada Rs.200. Galat ya khali code ho to amount waisa hi rahe.

Kya banana hai
applyCoupon(String code, double total) likho jo final amount return kare
Code me extra space ya chhota-bada letter ho to bhi chale (" save10 ")
Null code ya negative total pe crash nahi hona chahiye
main me kam se kam 5 test cases print karo